# =================================================================
# ABox Instances extracted from:
#   Major Amendment to the Cybersecurity Law No. XII-1428
#   Amending Articles 1, 2, 4, 6, 10, 15, 16, 18
#   Repealing Article 8 (RRT powers)
#   Adding EU law annex
#   No. XIII-920, enacted 2017-12-19, Vilnius
#   Signed by President Dalia Grybauskaitė
#   Effective 2018-01-01
# =================================================================


# =================================================================
# SECTION 1: THE AMENDING STATUTE
# =================================================================

lld:XIII-920 a llo:Statute ;
    rdfs:label "Major Amendment to Cybersecurity Law – institutional consolidation (No. XIII-920)" ;
    rdfs:label "Major Amendment to Cybersecurity Law – institutional consolidation (No. XIII-920)"@en ;
    rdfs:label "Kibernetinio saugumo įstatymo Nr. XII-1428 1, 2, 4, 6, 10, 15, 16, 18 straipsnių pakeitimo, 8 straipsnio pripažinimo netekusiu galios ir įstatymo papildymo priedu įstatymas (Nr. XIII-920)"@lt ;
    rdfs:comment "Comprehensive institutional restructuring that removes the Communications Regulatory Authority (RRT) from cybersecurity governance entirely, transfers its supervisory functions over telecom and hosting providers to the National Cyber Security Centre (NKSC), expands NKSC powers to include security assessments, mandatory audits, and EU incident reporting, and adds an EU law transposition annex." ;
    rdfs:comment "Comprehensive institutional restructuring that removes the Communications Regulatory Authority (RRT) from cybersecurity governance entirely, transfers its supervisory functions over telecom and hosting providers to the National Cyber Security Centre (NKSC), expands NKSC powers to include security assessments, mandatory audits, and EU incident reporting, and adds an EU law transposition annex."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Visapusiškas institucinis pertvarkymas, visiškai pašalinantis Ryšių reguliavimo tarnybą (RRT) iš kibernetinio saugumo valdymo, perkeliantis jos priežiūros funkcijas dėl ryšių ir prieglobos paslaugų teikėjų Nacionaliniam kibernetinio saugumo centrui (NKSC), išplečiantis NKSC įgaliojimus apimant saugumo vertinimus, privalomus auditus ir pranešimus ES institucijoms, bei papildantis įstatymą ES teisės aktų priedu."@lt ;
    llo:hasDocID "No. XIII-920" ;
    llo:dateEnacted "2017-12-19"^^xsd:date ;
    llo:isPubliclyDisclosed true ;
    llo:proposesAmendmentTo lld:XII-1428 ;
    llo:transposesDirective lld:EU_Dir_2002_21_EC ;
    llo:hasComponent lld:XIII-920_Art1 ,
                     lld:XIII-920_Art2 ,
                     lld:XIII-920_Art3 ,
                     lld:XIII-920_Art4 ,
                     lld:XIII-920_Art5 ,
                     lld:XIII-920_Art6 ,
                     lld:XIII-920_Art7 ,
                     lld:XIII-920_Art8 ,
                     lld:XIII-920_Art9 ,
                     lld:XIII-920_Art10 ,
                     lld:XIII-920_Art11 .


